  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_01",
      "hash64": "D8EAE990BCF2D5B0",
      "text": "Feast your eyes on the majesty of the Polar Plaza\\nbattle court![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_02",
      "hash64": "D8EAEC90BCF2DAC9",
      "text": "Nah, it’s basically the exact same battle court as\\nin the other plazas, just colder.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_03",
      "hash64": "D8EAEB90BCF2D916",
      "text": "I’m a cold-weather kinda guy. Not what you’d\\nexpect from a Dragon-type user, right?[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_04",
      "hash64": "D8EAEE90BCF2DE2F",
      "text": "Anyhow, buddy, you came to do my Elite Trial,\\nnot listen to me ramble. So let’s hop to it![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_05",
      "hash64": "D8EAED90BCF2DC7C",
      "text": "I call my Elite Trial [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Terarium-Only Battles[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_06",
      "hash64": "D8EAF090BCF2E195",
      "text": "Your goal’s to clobber three of your fellow\\nLeague Clubbers in battle. Simple enough, right?[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_07",
      "hash64": "D8EAEF90BCF2DFE2",
      "text": "But it’s called Terarium-Only for a reason! You\\ncan only use Pokémon that meet two conditions.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_10",
      "hash64": "D8E78490BCEFF43A",
      "text": "First, they gotta be Pokémon that were [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]caught[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]living wild in the Terarium[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 54,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_12",
      "hash64": "D8E78290BCEFF0D4",
      "text": "Second, [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]YOU gotta be the one who caught ’em[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_13",
      "hash64": "D8E78390BCEFF287",
      "text": "Unless your whole party of Pokémon meets\\nthose conditions, no Elite Trial for you.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_14",
      "hash64": "D8E78090BCEFED6E",
      "text": "I know, I’m asking a lot. But what fun would it\\nbe if you just dipped into your vault of beefy\\r\\nPokémon and cheesed your way through?[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 135,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_15",
      "hash64": "D8E78190BCEFEF21",
      "text": "Your opponents are under the same conditions,\\nso you can’t be too mad about it.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_16",
      "hash64": "D8E77E90BCEFEA08",
      "text": "Whaddya say, bud? Ready for my Elite Trial?[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_select_01",
      "hash64": "2F6D9CFA77AE15BD",
      "text": "I’m ready!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_select_02",
      "hash64": "2F6D99FA77AE10A4",
      "text": "Explain again?",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_select_03",
      "hash64": "2F6D9AFA77AE1257",
      "text": "Maybe later",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_17",
      "hash64": "D8E77F90BCEFEBBB",
      "text": "That’s your cue, underlings! C’mon out![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_enemy_all_01",
      "hash64": "C7BA86F4AC3BE73F",
      "text": "\t           I’m ready!\\nHello!\t\t\t         \t  Let’s go![VAR 0x0114(004D)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_18",
      "hash64": "D8E77C90BCEFE6A2",
      "text": "My trial’s about skill, but it’s chill. Take it at\\nwhatever pace you want.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_19",
      "hash64": "D8E77D90BCEFE855",
      "text": "If you wanna dive right into battling your three\\nclubmates, go nuts![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_20",
      "hash64": "D8E3FE90BCECDAB1",
      "text": "Rather stroll around the Terarium catching\\nPokémon first? No problem![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_21",
      "hash64": "D8E3FD90BCECD8FE",
      "text": "So go on, get out there and chill it up.\\nGood luck! Everyone give it your best shot![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_npc",
      "hash64": "9FCE05EF699E9EFA",
      "text": "Wanna dive right into battling? Rather go take a\\nbreather? Either way’s good.\\c\\nShow me your skill, but it’s chill.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 116,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_enemy_a_01",
      "hash64": "60B74CB7C5C4B4DF",
      "text": "I love Pokémon with some brittle gray tones!\\nReady to battle me?",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_enemy_a_04",
      "hash64": "60B747B7C5C4AC60",
      "text": "Gray-cious me! Your Pokémon do[VAR 0x1101(00FD,0002)]esn’t meet the\\ntrial conditions!\\c\\nCome back with only Pokémon you caught\\nyourself here in the Terarium!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1101",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FD",
            "0002"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_enemy_a_02",
      "hash64": "60B74DB7C5C4B692",
      "text": "Hoo-gray! Good luck to both of us!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_enemy_a_03",
      "hash64": "60B74EB7C5C4B845",
      "text": "You’ve got my support! I know you’ll do gray-t!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_enemy_b_01",
      "hash64": "377F54C3104234C8",
      "text": "I’m quite the cool customer. Ready to shiver?",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_enemy_b_04",
      "hash64": "377F59C310423D47",
      "text": "Oh, wait. Your Pokémon do[VAR 0x1101(00FD,0002)]esn’t meet the\\nconditions for this trial.\\c\\nCome back with only Pokémon you caught\\nyourself here in the Terarium.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1101",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FD",
            "0002"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_enemy_b_02",
      "hash64": "377F57C3104239E1",
      "text": "Heh. You’re on!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_enemy_b_03",
      "hash64": "377F56C31042382E",
      "text": "Don’t let the cold wear you down. I’m sending\\ncool waves of encouragement your way.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_enemy_c_01",
      "hash64": "638660C971AC4DDD",
      "text": "Y’know Iono? The streamer? I use the same type\\nas her, so like, ready for a shock?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_enemy_c_04",
      "hash64": "63865BC971AC455E",
      "text": "You know your Pokémon do[VAR 0x1101(00FD,0002)]esn’t meet the trial\\nconditions, right?\\c\\nCome back with only Pokémon you caught\\nyourself here in the Terarium!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1101",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FD",
            "0002"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_enemy_c_02",
      "hash64": "63865DC971AC48C4",
      "text": "Here we go! Zap! Pew pew pew!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_enemy_c_03",
      "hash64": "63865EC971AC4A77",
      "text": "Keep it up! I’ll be watchin’ over your electrifying\\nbattles!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_22",
      "hash64": "D8E3FC90BCECD74B",
      "text": "So that makes, let’s see...\\nOne...two...three...[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
